The Portuguese \TeX\ community held its first meeting on September 4, 2025, in
Évora, Portugal. Colocated with INForum\ (\url{https://www.inforum.pt}), the event gathered
academics and professionals to discuss recent developments in \LaTeX, practical
documentation workflows, design, typography, and the use of AI\ tools in document
preparation. This report summarizes the program, participation, and future outlook
for the Portuguese \TeX\ Users Group (TUG-PT, \url{https://www.tug.pt}).
